# AgroAssist Pro Cloudflare Pages SPA Routing Rules & Dynamic URL Rewrites
# Rewrites dynamic creation routes and dynamic entity paths to exact static HTML shells (HTTP 200)

# Farm Sub-routes (Specific paths first)
/farms/new /farms/new.html 200
/farms/crops/new /farms/crops/new.html 200
/farms/:farmId/crops/new /farms/crops/new?farmId=:farmId 200
/farms/:farmId/crops /farms/_/crops.html 200
/farms/:farmId/edit /farms/_/edit.html 200
/farms/:farmId/risk /farms/_/risk.html 200
/farms/:farmId/weather /farms/_/weather.html 200
/farms/:farmId /farms/_.html 200

# Crop Sub-routes
/crops/:cropId/edit /crops/_/edit.html 200
/crops/:cropId/risk /crops/_/risk.html 200
/crops/:cropId /crops/_.html 200

# Analysis Sub-routes
/analysis/history /analysis/history.html 200
/analysis/:analysisId /analysis/_.html 200

# Top-level SPA Fallbacks
/farms /farms.html 200
/crops /crops.html 200
/analysis /analysis.html 200
/* /index.html 200
